{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t control your speed, only your steering. Stripped down to this simple yet demanding mechanic, every drift becomes a test of focus, and every parry with your shield keeps the journey alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through abstract mindscapes inspired by psychedelic and retro-futuristic aesthetics of the 1980s. From synthwave to deep space and cyberpunk, experience a unique music-driven journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, explore each level at your own rhythm, learning every mechanic. Once you\u2019ve mastered everything, embark on Rush Mode, a continuous run across all levels that will unlock the path to the ultimate challenge waiting at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3381950?t=1764704637","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381950/d6bc422ca7619c7c5f377c30d254f0db15c38b77/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764704637","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381950/ab1d484eaf6d12a733bffa665d934de075ceb9e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764704637","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381950/ab1d484eaf6d12a733bffa665d934de075ceb9e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764704637","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t control your speed, only your steering. Stripped down to this simple yet demanding mechanic, every drift becomes a test of focus, and every parry with your shield keeps the journey alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through abstract mind